/Title (The page loads and initializes an empty board using the default size. The user enters a value of N between 4 and 12. The Solve button validates the input and starts a fresh solving cycle. The backtracking solver computes all valid arrangements and stores them. The total number of solutions is displayed in the status message area. The first valid solution is shown on the board. The user navigates through other solutions using previous and next controls. The Reset button or input change clears the current state and redraws the board.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1017 0 R
>>
